        "code": "% コンパイルして保存\n\\+ \\+ (\n    compile_recursive(count_items/3, [], _BashCode),\n    setup_call_cleanup(\n        open('../output/count_items_demo.sh', write, _Stream),\n        write(_Stream, _BashCode),\n        close(_Stream)),\n    writeln('✓ Compiled count_items to Bash with tail recursion optimization')\n).",
