      {
        "id": 14,
        "code": "## パターン 2: 線形再帰（Linear Recursion）\n\n線形再帰は節ごとに**ちょうど1つ**の再帰呼び出しを持ち、再帰呼び出しが戻った後に計算が行われます。\n\n### 例: 階乗（Factorial）",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 15,
        "code": "% 階乗を定義\n:- dynamic factorial/2.\n\n% 基底ケース\nfactorial(0, 1).\n\n% 再帰ケース: ちょうど1回の再帰呼び出し\nfactorial(N, F) :-\n    N > 0,\n    N1 is N - 1,\n    factorial(N1, F1),  % ← 1回の再帰呼び出し\n    F is N * F1.        % ← 呼び出し後の計算",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 16,
        "code": "### Prolog でのテスト",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 17,
        "code": "% テスト: 5の階乗\n\\+ \\+ (\n    factorial(5, _F),\n    format('5! = ~w~n', [_F])\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "5! = 120",
