        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">[5,[3,[1,[],[]],[]],[2,[],[]]] の木の合計:\n</pre><pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">error: source: failed to source file: ../output/tree_sum_demo.sh\nerror: failed to execute command 'tree_sum': operation not supported on this platform\n</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 32,
        "code": "## パターン 4: 相互再帰（Mutual Recursion）\n\n相互再帰は、2つ以上の述語が循環して互いを呼び出すときに発生します。\n\n### 例: 偶数（Even）と奇数（Odd）",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 33,
        "code": "% 相互再帰の is_even と is_odd を定義\n:- dynamic is_even/1.\n:- dynamic is_odd/1.\n\n% is_even の基底ケース\nis_even(0).\n\n% is_even の再帰: N-1 が奇数なら N は偶数\nis_even(N) :-\n    N > 0,\n    N1 is N - 1,\n    is_odd(N1).  % ← is_odd を呼び出し\n\n% is_odd の基底ケース\nis_odd(1).\n\n% is_odd の再帰: N-1 が偶数なら N は奇数\nis_odd(N) :-\n    N > 1,\n    N1 is N - 1,\n    is_even(N1).  % ← is_even を呼び出し",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 34,
        "code": "### Prolog でのテスト",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 35,
        "code": "% 偶数/奇数のテスト\nis_even(0), writeln('✓ 0 is even').\nis_even(4), writeln('✓ 4 is even').\nis_odd(3), writeln('✓ 3 is odd').\nis_odd(7), writeln('✓ 7 is odd').",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "✓ 0 is even\n✓ 4 is even\n✓ 3 is odd\n✓ 7 is odd",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">✓ 0 is even\n✓ 4 is even\n✓ 3 is odd\n✓ 7 is odd</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 36,
        "code": "### 相互再帰のチェック",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 37,
        "code": "% コールグラフを構築して SCC を検出\n\\+ \\+ (\n    use_module(unifyweaver(core/advanced/call_graph)),\n    use_module(unifyweaver(core/advanced/scc_detection)),\n\n    build_call_graph([is_even/1, is_odd/1], _Graph),\n    format('Call graph: ~w~n', [_Graph]),\n\n    find_sccs(_Graph, _SCCs),\n    format('SCCs (mutual recursion groups): ~w~n', [_SCCs])\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "source_sink `unifyweaver(core/advanced/call_graph)' does not exist",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">source_sink `unifyweaver(core/advanced/call_graph)' does not exist</pre>"
      },
      {
